            "question": "Can I use it on a brand-new tattoo?",
            "answer": "<p>That's exactly what it's built for. Restore Balm goes on from day zero: the thinnest possible layer on clean, dry skin, matte not shiny. Always follow the aftercare instructions your artist gives you first; the full day-by-day routine is in <a href=\"/pages/healing-guide\">The Healing Guide</a>.</p>"
          }
