          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I have sensitive skin. Anything I should know?",
            "answer": "<p>Patch test first: a small amount on the inside of your forearm, wait 24 hours. If you have a skin condition or a known allergy, check with your doctor or pharmacist before use, and always follow your artist's instructions on fresh work.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-last": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does a set last?",
            "answer": "<p>Depends on the size of the work. For a typical piece, Restore Balm sees out the two-week close with plenty in reserve, and Recovery Cream gives you months of daily care. Thin layers are the trick: a drowned tattoo can't breathe, and thick layers just waste product.</p>"
          }
        },
