            "question": "Does it work on old, healed tattoos?",
            "answer": "<p>That's half the reason it exists. Dry skin scatters light and makes black look grey; hydrated skin holds line work sharp and colour saturated. Recovery Cream, daily, on every piece you own. Sixty seconds after a shower.</p>"
